      "ts": "20261022_1403",
      "sender_norm": "POLITICO",
      "subject": "Parliament votes on Automotive Package",
      "subject_en": "Parliament votes on Automotive Package",
      "html": "data/pdfs/20261022_1403_Parliament_votes_on_Automotive_Package.html",
      "pdf": "data/pdfs/20261022_1403_Parliament_votes_on_Automotive_Package.html",
      "summary_en": "EU lawmakers are weighing changes to automaker CO2 targets, but a full plenary vote on the Automotive Package has slipped to December pending progress on a related Industrial Accelerator Act. Meanwhile, the Parliament's TRAN and ITRE committees moved ahead today with their own compromise positions, including a proposed 87.5% emissions cut by 2035, feeding into the lead ENVI committee's vote set for Nov. 4.",
      "summary_ja": "EU議会は自動車メーカーのCO2目標見直しを審議しているが、「自動車パッケージ」の本会議採決は、関連する産業加速化法(IAA)の進展待ちで12月に延期された。一方、TRAN(運輸)・ITRE(産業・エネルギー)両委員会は本日、2035年までに87.5%の排出削減を柱とする妥協案を採択し、主導委員会であるENVI(環境)が11月4日に採決する予定の審議に反映される。",
